- <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`identifier`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Identifier`" pulumi-lang-go="`identifier`" pulumi-lang-python="`identifier`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`identifier`" pulumi-lang-java="`identifier`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`identifier`">`identifier`</span> is the unique registry identifier

