- The <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`filename`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Filename`" pulumi-lang-go="`filename`" pulumi-lang-python="`filename`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`filename`" pulumi-lang-java="`filename`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`filename`">`filename`</span> is automatically derived from <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`filePath`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`FilePath`" pulumi-lang-go="`filePath`" pulumi-lang-python="`file_path`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`filePath`" pulumi-lang-java="`filePath`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`file_path`">`filePath`</span> if not explicitly provided.
